      <br />
      \(\large{x &euro; \overset{\phantom{\name_head[1]}-\phantom{\p} \%\phantom{\name_head[1]}}{\underset{\times \phantom{\cm}}{\mapsto}} \phantom{\nv} &euro;}\)
